ws in en-US.","Every visible string is bound with $i18n except identities (diagnostic codes and paths, Locale tags, theme keys and Widget type names); en-US and zh-TW keep identical key sets.","Visual language follows the Quiet Canvas design system in DESIGN.md."],"decisions":[],"entryConditions":["The Workbench canvas, a capture or a version comparison loaded /preview in a frame with a session, a View, a Variant and a render context. The document has no Workbench shell and renders only one of these states at a time; the base state is loading.","The host follows the brightness of the Workspace theme it renders, never the Workbench appearance, so every state is shown in the theme of the render context selected here.","The render context selects one Workspace viewport preset, one Locale and one theme; the states are read by the Workbench canvas through the frame, so they appear inside the canvas frame at the previewed viewport."],"intent":"Show what the Preview host document (app/pages/preview.vue, the page behind the canvas frame at /preview) shows in place of a rendered View: loading, no View selected, a load error, an unsupported Widget type, a Runtime that could not be constructed, a blocked Preview (the primary Locale has no file), an unsupported theme, and an empty content slot.","interactionRules":["A load error names what could not be read (the bridge, the View, the primary Locale, the Assets the View uses, or a View a version does not hold) in one alert titled \"Could not load preview\"; there is no action in the frame, so recovery is a reload or a fix in the Workspace.","A Runtime construction failure shows the diagnostics, each as its code, its path and the Workbench sentence for the code; the Product Kit stylesheet and each provider entry are named by their own code and path.","While the primary Locale has no file the Preview is blocked and nothing is rendered; the host re-reads the file every two seconds and renders once it exists, so no control is offered.","A theme the active Adapters do not support is reported in place of the View with the render-context diagnostic; no other theme stands in.","A View whose content slot is empty shows a dashed empty block that names the slot and the Widget Core package; it is still a ready Preview."],"references":[{"label":"Phase 5 of the closed loop: dogfood coverage of the core surfaces","relation":"decision","type":"external","uri":"https://github.com/DevilTea/uiux/discussions/379#discussioncomment-19257377"},{"label":"Route coverage: /preview maps to the Preview host View","relation":"decision","type":"external","uri":"https://github.com/DevilTea/uiux/discussions/379#discussioncomment-19293828"}],"requirements":[]},"variants":{"adapter-unavailable":{"state":{"g-adapter-unavailable":{"visible":true},"g-blocked":{"visible":false},"g-empty-slot":{"visible":false},"g-error":{"visible":false},"g-invalid-bundle":{"visible":false},"g-invalid-provider":{"visible":false},"g-invalid-stylesheet":{"visible":false},"g-loading":{"visible":false},"g-no-view":{"visible":false},"g-theme":{"visible":false}}},"blocked":{"requirements":["01a115cd-b30b-706e-b8a2-46e62259156e"],"state":{"g-adapter-unavailable":{"visible":false},"g-blocked":{"visible":true},"g-empty-slot":{"visible":false},"g-error":{"visible":false},"g-invalid-bundle":{"visible":false},"g-invalid-provider":{"visible":false},"g-invalid-stylesheet":{"visible":false},"g-loading":{"visible":false},"g-no-view":{"visible":false},"g-theme":{"visible":false}}},"empty-content-slot":{"state":{"g-adapter-unavailable":{"visible":false},"g-blocked":{"visible":false},"g-empty-slot":{"visible":true},"g-error":{"visible":false},"g-invalid-bundle":{"visible":false},"g-invalid-provider":{"visible":false},"g-invalid-stylesheet":{"visible":false},"g-loading":{"visible":false},"g-no-view":{"visible":false},"g-theme":{"visible":false}}},"error-assets-load":{"state":{"e-assets":{"visible":true},"g-adapter-unavailable":{"visible":false},"g-blocked":{"visi